    "id": "2104805931993170126",
    "author": "MattRobbt",
    "name": "Matt Robb",
    "text": "One thing humans will always do better than AI is tell stories. It doesn’t scare me as a content creator being replaced by something that can produce better visuals in a fraction of the time. I know myself that I go to watch creators for not just their story but their experience, growth, good days and bad. Comparing myself, my life my current situation or items in my life to the ones that person has is why I follow them and being influenced to be like them also has its factor.",
