  {
    "id": "2104806108032373132",
    "author": "MattRobbt",
    "name": "Matt Robb",
    "text": "AI can replicate a masterpiece but if it doesn’t have a fundamental meaning behind it then its got little value regardless of looking the same at face value. So many brands don’t get this 🙄. I don’t think this is ever going to change tbh. It’s part of who we are and its one of the reasons people shoot film even tho digital is faster and better with less imperfections.",
