  {
    "id": "2104806386609598474",
    "author": "MattRobbt",
    "name": "Matt Robb",
    "text": "Even today big Hollywood movies are still shot on film and famous photographers still take their masterpieces on film despite digital being around. AI has genuinely made me go back to my roots a little with a pen and paper old school style and I’m even shooting a lot on film because there’s meaning and a story behind each shot and each pen stroke. I definitely still think AI has its use cases but the story needs to be there and using AI to tell stories can work sometimes but only with a life with a story behind the scenes.",
